A '''rickshaw'''<ref name="Shades of Reason EG">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/shades-of-reason-episode-guide|text="Shades of Reason" Episode Guide &#124; The Clone Wars}}</ref> was a type of vehicle that consisted of a covered two-person [[repulsorlift]] chair attached to a pair of long poles that were pulled by an [[RIC-series general labor droid]] who provided the vehicle locomotion. [[Anakin Skywalker]] and [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] once rode in a rickshaw operated by the rickshaw [[droid]] [[RIC-920]] when visiting [[Mos Espa]], a [[Spaceport|port]] [[city]] located on the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]].<ref name="Attack of the Clones">{{Film|II}}</ref> Also in Mos Espa, two [[Bith]] were pulled on a rickshaw by a droid during the chase of [[Mayor]] [[Mok Shaiz]]'s [[Mok Shaiz's majordomo|majordomo]].<ref name="Chapter 3">{{BOBF|Chapter 3: The Streets of Mos Espa}}</ref>

